2026-10-10T01:53:04.7353342Z         installed. The version probe timeout went 5s ? 12s (cold starts), and since
2026-10-10T01:53:04.7397228Z         <code>cc</code> is also the C compiler's name, the plugin now resolves the
2026-10-10T01:53:04.7604617Z         binary with fallback (<code>cc ? chainlesschain ? clc ? clchain</code>) and
2026-10-10T01:53:04.7608210Z         uses it for the chat spawn and every probe.
2026-10-10T01:53:04.7608825Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-10T01:53:04.7733890Z         <b>0.4.25</b> � the agent can actually ask you a question:
2026-10-10T01:53:04.7938527Z         <code>ask_user_question</code> now pops a dialog (single-choice / multi-select
2026-10-10T01:53:04.7955614Z         checkboxes / free-text input) so the agent can clarify instead of guessing.
2026-10-10T01:53:04.7959302Z         Requires <code>cc</code> ? 0.162.95.
2026-10-10T01:53:04.8012881Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-10T01:53:04.8198828Z         <b>0.4.24</b> � fix: a graceful "couldn't ask in the panel" degradation no
2026-10-10T01:53:04.8347197Z         longer renders as a scary <b>? ask_user_question</b> failure.
2026-10-10T01:53:04.8348512Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-10T01:53:04.8553955Z         <b>0.4.23</b> � new <b>? LLM ? ?? cc ??�</b> menu item (check on demand),
