2026-10-10T01:58:17.7321112Z         binary with fallback (<code>cc ? chainlesschain ? clc ? clchain</code>) and
2026-10-10T01:58:17.7322374Z         uses it for the chat spawn and every probe.
2026-10-10T01:58:17.7322885Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-10T01:58:17.7323518Z         <b>0.4.25</b> � the agent can actually ask you a question:
