2026-10-10T01:58:17.7332412Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-10T01:58:17.7333276Z         <b>0.4.23</b> � new <b>? LLM ? ?? cc ??�</b> menu item (check on demand),
2026-10-10T01:58:17.7334188Z         plus a clear hint when the <code>cc</code> CLI isn't installed.
2026-10-10T01:58:17.7335163Z         <br/><br/>
