2026-10-10T02:05:35.2676123Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-10T02:05:35.2708115Z         <b>0.4.26</b> � fix: no more false "???? cc CLI" when <code>cc</code> IS
2026-10-10T02:05:35.2711686Z         installed. The version probe timeout went 5s ? 12s (cold starts), and since
2026-10-10T02:05:35.2724425Z         <code>cc</code> is also the C compiler's name, the plugin now resolves the
2026-10-10T02:05:35.2728241Z         binary with fallback (<code>cc ? chainlesschain ? clc ? clchain</code>) and
2026-10-10T02:05:35.2734886Z         uses it for the chat spawn and every probe.
2026-10-10T02:05:35.2761745Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-10T02:05:35.2769163Z         <b>0.4.25</b> � the agent can actually ask you a question:
2026-10-10T02:05:35.2773852Z         <code>ask_user_question</code> now pops a dialog (single-choice / multi-select
2026-10-10T02:05:35.2775062Z         checkboxes / free-text input) so the agent can clarify instead of guessing.
2026-10-10T02:05:35.2776446Z         Requires <code>cc</code> ? 0.162.95.
2026-10-10T02:05:35.2781768Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-10T02:05:35.2794070Z         <b>0.4.24</b> � fix: a graceful "couldn't ask in the panel" degradation no
