2026-10-10T02:05:35.2807309Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-10T02:05:35.2853044Z         <b>0.4.23</b> � new <b>? LLM ? ?? cc ??�</b> menu item (check on demand),
2026-10-10T02:05:35.2854388Z         plus a clear hint when the <code>cc</code> CLI isn't installed.
2026-10-10T02:05:35.2861075Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-10T02:05:35.2869847Z         <b>0.4.22</b> � you're now told when a newer <code>cc</code> CLI is published
