2026-10-10T02:05:35.2876723Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-10T02:05:35.2877657Z         <b>0.4.21</b> � fix: reconfiguring the LLM now restarts the running chat so it
2026-10-10T02:05:35.2878647Z         picks up the new provider/model/key (no more "?????? / ??????").
2026-10-10T02:05:35.2879326Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-10T02:05:35.2880393Z         <b>0.4.20</b> � new <code>/review</code> command: review your uncommitted git
2026-10-10T02:05:35.2881254Z         diff right from the chat (matches the VS Code panel).
2026-10-10T02:05:35.2881972Z         <br/><br/>
