2026-10-10T02:05:35.2972213Z         parity).
2026-10-10T02:05:35.2972770Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-10T02:05:35.2973704Z         <b>0.4.14</b> � extended-thinking reasoning (with <code>/think</code>) now
2026-10-10T02:05:35.2975176Z         streams into the transcript dimmed/italic, set apart from the answer
